	(title_block
		(title "Generic USB-A 3.0 downstream port (one sheet, three instances)")
		(rev "A")
		(comment 1 "Sheet 8/9/10 — see HARDWARE.md §8, FUNCTIONAL.md")
	)
	(lib_symbols)
	(text "USB PORT — one sheet, instantiated 3× as usb-port-1..3 (hub DS1..DS3). Any device fits any port.\nGolden reference: TUSB8041 EVM downstream port, datasheets/reference/ti-slvaf82b-esd-surge-protection-usb.pdf\nParts (LCSC): SY6280AAC C55136 (Ilim = 6800 / Rset, 1.5 A on every port, EN must not float), TPD4E05U06 C138714, USBLC6-2 C2687116, USB-A 3.0 HC-ST-003-01-J C2845330\nPins: SSTX/SSRX (SSTX = hub transmits, so input here), DP/DM, PWRCTL in from hub, OVERCUR_N out to hub.\nPower: +5V_USB → SY6280 → VBUS_OUT → receptacle. Name the switched output VBUS_OUT (pattern /usb-port-*/VBUS_OUT → PWR_USB); never name it VBUS.\nEverything per instance is identical (values, DNP and footprints are shared between instances).\nConsumes: +5V_USB, +3V3, GND."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
